Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马，你真的想好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。他那份觉悟是真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是我们也不知道能不能赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）我知道。但是我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道那家伙真正的心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想来一场真正的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗就能了解对方的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说这话的应该是你才对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了，我不再多说什么了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你的心之碎片还有4个。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能否进入WDC决赛全看这场决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）那当然了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是最后一场战斗了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）痛痛快快地看游马怎么收场吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底可不能不看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这帮家伙觉得我会输吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗你的骗你的 我才没这么想呢呜拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很期待哦 游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都留到这一步了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马毫无疑问是我们最强的决斗者！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫能夺冠的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了 V 一脸闷闷不乐的样子啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）来自星光体世界的使者之力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可小觑。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用担心 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会赢的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:02:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((啊哈哈哈哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）呜哇～！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他忍受了痛苦从而得到了力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到了如此强大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你久等了，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）游马，我为了打倒你获得了新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见到你，看到你的家人我确信了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.31,0:04:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也为了夺回自己的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能打倒你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想知道你真正的想法。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗之后就能成为同伴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能了解那家伙的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里的每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是通过决斗建立起羁绊的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我和你也一定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有着那份羁绊，我相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻由我来。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《得到了托隆的力量现在的我的话…》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体你的身影 我能看得清清楚楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你正在成为游马的力量对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就算有你在我不会输！》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动　场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧帕兹之城·巴比伦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:05:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～　这是什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）上了　游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将　欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}图拉·守护者特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场地魔法发动中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再　将欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄金·穿梭机通常召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄金·穿梭机的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这只怪兽的等级提升１级。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将　等级５的黄金·穿梭机和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用图拉守卫进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:07:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.33！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧帕兹超兵器 马修·马克！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就召唤出马修·马克！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 试着打倒我吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了伤害别人而决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才不叫决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不是那样的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从老爸那里学到的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天… 很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会让你用出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？ 上了 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别急，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的场上已经有马修·马克了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在只能优先防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《而且他那种气场……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和之前有什么不一样了》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之只是一味盲目攻击的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是赢不了他的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！我把怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 帕伦克的石棺！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有冠有欧帕兹之名的卡存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从卡组抽两张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我发动了通常魔法　这个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿兹特克面具魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿兹特克面具魔像）托！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.10,0:08:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊　那是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((我最喜欢的卡也一样　你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿兹特克面具魔像？))
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！　阿兹特克面具魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}佩伦克拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈～　托！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然　轰轰轰轰魔像。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力１５００的话这场战斗是平局。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰可不会被打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轰轰轰轰魔像）轰！　轰——　轰——！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且守备表示的轰轰轰轰魔像{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１回合只有一次不会被战斗破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　就算是马修·麦克的攻击也能扛得住！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目标　才不是战斗什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把　欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡布雷拉的投石机通常召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力　０的怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动卡布雷拉的投石机的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的怪兽　１只
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合　对手怪兽　１只的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成０！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下这诅咒吧　咯咯咯咯雷姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咯咯咯咯雷姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊　这个连招！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一刻　马修·麦克的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马修·麦克在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１回合一次使用一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭那变化后的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手玩家造成伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，造成1800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无限加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:11:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡布雷拉的投石机因为使用了效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样，我就回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.01,0:11:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了，乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种的…算不了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙，跟以前的决斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全不一样！到底…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果这就是他的王牌的话，我有对策。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想在自己的决斗中获胜啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法 反弹之杖。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我我我魔术师 一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将等级从1变成8。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 真是的！！我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 我我我魔术师的等级变成8！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！反弹之杖 效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备的魔法师族攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽的等级 乘以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}100点 提升！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！但是 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马修·马赫的效果不就会发动了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 他只是为了夺走微弱的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马修·马赫最后的叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该不会用。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师 攻击卡布雷拉的投石机。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那攻击我已经看穿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱 发动！哥斯达黎加石球。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以无效对方怪兽的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 那只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你的下个回合 无法攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师… 可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么样？星光体》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 把卡盖伏吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊… 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都怪你碍事！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖伏一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间我我我魔术师的等级恢复原状{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因反弹魔杖的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升的攻击力也会下降。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动欧帕兹之城·巴比伦的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次，将自己墓地中的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只欧帕兹怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将相同等级的欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将黄金穿梭机除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，从墓地中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把阿兹特克面具魔像拖出来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将卡布雷拉的投石机变为攻击表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次将阿兹特克面具魔像盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！你……到底是怎么了啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！怪兽只要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.41,0:14:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我的棋子就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明明那么说过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喜欢欧帕兹，却把那怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管付出什么牺牲，我都要赢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡布雷拉投石机的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上马修·麦格的效果的连招的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的生命值就只剩３００了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）这样一来再受到马修·麦格的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终，游马同学就输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等这个瞬间！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我突击，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动，我我我突击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.29,0:14:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为怪兽效果的对象时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个效果无效并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，使用了效果的怪兽的攻击力或守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其中较高的一项数值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手玩家伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡布雷拉投石机的守备力是1800。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.39,0:15:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就吃下这个伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.35,0:15:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，两人的生命值就持平了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.31,0:15:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！啊…难道你从一开始就打算这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在他的决斗执着于胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.97,0:15:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此才慎重。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起乱来一通的你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战术更好读懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是不是话太多了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼…就这样赢下去吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是，光是这样还不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我让我把真正的他夺回来…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的一飞冲天加上星光体的高等战术…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这两人的实力已经在我之上了吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 竟然牺牲欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这根本就不是你的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道你得到了什么力量虽然不知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你就打你自己的决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是不会明白的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被同伴围绕、过得幸福的你，是不会明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正痛苦的时候和悲伤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有任何人愿意陪在我身边我的那种心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易才夺回来的我的家人…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经残破不堪，彻底扭曲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…即便如此我我想守护啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……你真烦人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碍眼得很啊，你的一举一动都是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠入黑暗吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……怎么回事！？皇之钥！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要想战胜九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.28,0:17:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光靠强力的 No.卡是不够的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的父亲……九十九一马
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一位拥有不屈精神的冒险家。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的儿子……不可小觑。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的纹章之力会从游马那里夺走重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而等待着他的东西是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝望的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((一飞冲天啊，我！))
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:18:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.11,0:18:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《什么……　什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　是想说什么来着……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我忘了一件超级重要的事……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((一马：来吧　爬上来吧　游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做不到啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种东西怎么可能爬得上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不　你能爬上去的　……对吧　游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？　你刚才　说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说了什么啊？　老爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸……　老爸！))
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《好害怕……　好害怕……》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）呐。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九君　你不去挑战吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要啦……　太可怕了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西……　怎么可能跳得过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是　不去挑战一下的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不就不知道了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我懂。就算不去做。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我跳不了……跳不了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了，完美！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）啊哈哈，果然厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个胆小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你被吓到的那张不过是装备魔法卡而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛，真没劲……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊透顶的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.02,0:19:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，看了也是白看。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么胆小的家伙，真是决斗者的耻辱。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好可怕……好可怕啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起……对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《好可怕……好可怕啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都在嘲笑我……》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……碍眼的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠近他，窝囊气可是会传染的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是决斗者的耻辱啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好可怕…好可怕啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 会这么可怕？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么 非常重要的东西…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马…喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好可怕…好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 为什么会 进行这种决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能赢的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 不可能赢得了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 是靠纹章的力量…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天从他的心中消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马已经 看不见你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要被邪恶的力量吞噬啊 游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:21:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 我不会让你妨碍我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个纹章也有封印你的力量哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体… 消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 从你的记忆中一飞冲天已经消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要一飞冲天不回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.05,0:21:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就既看不见星光体，也看不见皇之键。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经不是我的对手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 麻修·马克！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击我我我魔术师！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.29,0:21:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 咕啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:22:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 就在绝望之中你给我消失吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵呵… 哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈… 哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.79,0:24:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 要介绍的怪兽是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.33,0:24:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太鼓魔人 点点点拍。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.80,0:24:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收对手的超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化为自己的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和点点点拍谐音，来解游马的考试题。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.84,0:24:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其答案是？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两边都是 3 分。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚吓——！

